@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Player" as Player
participant ":System" as System

activate Player

    Player -> System : asks to create a new railway line
    activate System

        System --> Player : shows existing stations and asks to select two of them
    deactivate System

    Player -> System : selects two stations
    activate System

        System --> Player : asks to select line details (i.e. if it's electrified,\n if it's single or double)
    deactivate System

    Player -> System : selects railway line details
    activate System

        System --> Player : shows all data and requests confirmation
    deactivate System

    Player -> System : confirms data
    activate System

        System --> Player : displays operation success
    deactivate System
@enduml